HISTORICAL RECORDS

1 Status

These documents record earlier development states. They are preserved for
provenance and are not current specifications or evidence of independent
expert review. Current source structure and result boundaries are in
documentation/DEVELOPMENT.txt, with paths stated relative to the repository
root.

The August reports predate the repair of literal list equality in the
numerical output contract. The October audit predates the independent core
extraction. In the repository organisation revision, their prose is preserved
and relative link destinations are updated for moved documents.

